Z||000015||Gokart||03-28-2000||07:16 AM||||Nice pictures! Looked like alot of fun. Is that those "Action Jackson" quarter windows on the GT in pic#5? Sure looks lik'em!<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 03-28-2000).]||||reg||7
Z||000016||mrfixit58||03-28-2000||08:38 AM||||Gokart,<P>I don't know what you call those but there was a set for sale on Ebay a couple of months ago. That particular car is really nice. He has painted his tail lights lenses in the shape simular to those of a Geo, and they look good. He also has a killer turbo setup. I'll try to remember to post the motor pic this evening.<P>Roy L.<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000017||Phil||03-28-2000||10:39 AM||||My car used to be that gawd awful red. Red should be banned from the face of the earth.||||reg||1
Z||000018||Raydar||03-28-2000||10:50 AM||||Great pics and cars, guys!<BR>I'm thoroughly impressed (and greatly humbled).<P>Yes, Phil, red would be my *last* color choice. It figures that both of mine would be "arrest me" red. Just couldn't pass up the deals. ||||reg||1
